  "solution": {
    "text": "Let atomic weight of element P is p and that of element Q is q.<br/><br/>For  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>.</mo></mrow></mfrac></math> <br/><br/> <math><mn>0.1</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> <br/><br/> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0.1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></math>      ...(i)<br/><br/>For  <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>.</mo></mrow></mfrac></math> <br/><br/> <math><mn>0.05</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> <br/><br/> <math><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0.05</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>180</mn></math>      ...(ii)<br/><br/>On solving equation (i) and (ii) we get q = 30<br/><br/> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></math> <br/><br/> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn></math>",
